group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay, Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$340</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p>The <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Fence</strong> is a schematic of a fence what you can build on your base.\n</p><p>Desc: Resizable fence schematic. Keeps the noobs out.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This schematic scales accordingly to optimize the number of \"legs\" (vertical part) every few studs.</li>\n<li>A similar looking structure appears on your base a few studs outside and varies in size based on your property size, and it appears whenever entry to said property is disallowed for said user. This fence is purely \"holographic\" and serves no point beyond a visual indicator to others that entry has been denied.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163204\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 60/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 60/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019424/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.211      1 Template:Schematics\n100.00%   45.211      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:259-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163204 and revision id 16670. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Schematics"],"links":[{"title":"Illumine Designs","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"images":["Fence.png","Fence_placed.png"]}
